16 | BEST PRACTICES:
17 | 1. Use this tool FIRST to locate relevant files fast
18 | 2. Use specific search patterns: "class_name", "function_name", or "import.*module"
19 | 3. Prefer narrowing with filePattern like "*.ts" when possible
20 | 4. Avoid broad patterns like "http|request|fetch" unless needed
21 | 5. After you find the right file, read it fully instead of searching again
22 | 
23 | WHEN TO USE:
24 | - Finding specific function/class definitions
25 | - Locating import statements or usage patterns
26 | - Searching for specific error messages or constants
27 | 
28 | WHEN NOT TO USE:
